# KENWELL TX Platform

An enterprise token management system, automated AI chatbot orchestration engine, and high-performance network proxy pipeline designed for the **KENWELL-TX-ORG** ecosystem. 

This platform seamlessly bridges data ingestion pipelines, customs compliance logging matrix networks, and structural security governance architectures.

---

## ⚡ System Architecture Topology

The application operates as a decoupled, dual-engine infrastructure layout managed concurrently to guarantee isolation, high throughput, and database transaction integrity:

```text
               [ Desktop Web UI Workspace Client ]
                               │
                       ( HTTP Port 8000 )
                               ▼
               [ Kenwell Python Proxy Gateway ] (Kenwell.py)
                               │
                       ( HTTP Port 3000 )
                               ▼
          [ Express Core Transaction Engine ] (server.js)
                               │
                  ( SQLite Persistent Storage )
                         (database.db)
```

1. **Client Desktop Workspace Layer**: A responsive dark-mode control interface styled with Tailwind CSS, supporting automated data classification pipelines and integrated telemetry testing matrices.
2. **Kenwell Python Proxy Gateway (Port 8000)**: A lightweight, high-performance orchestration layer handling secure payload forwarding, active CORS overrides, and AI-assisted chatbot session abstraction lines.
3. **Express Core Database Engine (Port 3000)**: A persistent backend engine running under **PM2** process daemons to coordinate intelligence ingestion writes and SQLite local disk interactions.

---

